  "notes": [
    "**Aterrizar** is a regular **-AR verb** with a spelling change",
    "Spelling change: z→c before é (aterricé, not \"aterrizé\") - same pattern as empezar",
    "This spelling change only affects the \"yo\" form in preterite",
    "Used for airplanes/helicopters landing",
    "Opposite: **despegar** (to take off)",
    "Common usage: *El avión aterrizó a tiempo* (The plane landed on time)",
    "Related noun: **el aterrizaje** (landing)"
  ],
